---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import Verify from '../components/Verify.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<LegalLayout title="Cookie Policy" heading="Cookie policy" description="Which cookies and browser storage the Bergkraft website uses, and how to change your choice.">
  <p>
    This website uses as little browser storage as possible. Nothing optional is stored or loaded unless you
    agree to it.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choice</h2>
  <p>
    On your first visit you are asked whether analytics may be used. “Accept” and “Decline” are equal
    options, and the website works the same with either. You can change your decision at any time:
  </p>
  <p><button type="button" class="btn btn--plain" data-consent-open>Open cookie settings</button></p>

  <h2>Necessary storage</h2>
  <div class="table">
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th scope="col">Name</th><th scope="col">Type</th><th scope="col">Purpose</th><th scope="col">Duration</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>bk-analytics-consent</td><td>Local storage</td><td>Remembers whether you accepted or declined analytics.</td><td>Until you clear your browser storage</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p>Legal basis: § 25(2) TDDDG. No consent is required because the entry is needed to respect your choice.</p>

  <h2>Analytics cookies (only after you accept)</h2>
  <div class="table">
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th scope="col">Name</th><th scope="col">Provider</th><th scope="col">Purpose</th><th scope="col">Duration</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>_ga</td><td>Google Analytics</td><td>Distinguishes visitors for usage statistics.</td><td>Up to 2 years</td></tr>
        <tr><td>_ga_{site.ga4Id.replace('G-', '')}</td><td>Google Analytics</td><td>Keeps the state of a visit.</td><td>Up to 2 years</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p>
    Legal basis: your consent (§ 25(1) TDDDG, Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR). If you decline or later withdraw consent,
    Google Analytics is switched off and its cookies are removed from this site where the browser allows it.
  </p>
  <Verify>
    <ul>
      <li>Cookie names and durations against the live Google Analytics configuration after launch.</li>
      <li>That no other tags, pixels or embedded services have been added to the website.</li>
    </ul>
  </Verify>

  <h2>What we do not use</h2>
  <p>No advertising cookies, no social media plugins and no third-party fonts.</p>

  <h2>More information</h2>
  <p>See the <a href="/datenschutz/">privacy policy</a> for details on data processing and your rights.</p>
</LegalLayout>

<style>
  .table { overflow-x: auto; margin-bottom: var(--s-4); }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: var(--t-sm); min-width: 34rem; }
  th, td { text-align: left; vertical-align: top; padding: var(--s-3) var(--s-4) var(--s-3) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--c-line); }
  th { font-size: var(--t-xs); letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--c-brass-deep); }
</style>
